{"title": "Elixir of Radiant Resistance", "pageid": 13391, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/84/ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Radiant Resistance image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/ELX_Elixir_of_Radiant_Resistance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF ;\">Elixir of Radiant Resistance</span></a> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixir</a> that grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistance</a> when consumed.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>There's a hint of brimstone to this bubbling brew.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" titl